const description = 'Usually as a mailing address, rarely as your home or business street address. What the federal bank ID rule (31 CFR 1020.220) asks for, what Mercury accepts in each address field, and what US Global Mail, Stable and Virtual Post Mail tell their own customers. Checked Nov 22, 2026.';
